usage: validate_macos.py [-h] [--output OUTPUT] [--gib]

Local-only Apple Silicon validation. Never opens the real biometric dataset.
Install with python3.12 -m pip install -e '.[dev]', then run: python3.12 -m
scripts.validate_macos --output results/macos-local

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
  --gib            also profile a 1 GiB synthetic file
